  "result": "The `TypedArray.prototype.toString` ticket needs no change to this file, so I made no edits. All 6 target tests already pass.\n\nThe spec says `%TypedArray%.prototype.toString` is the same function object as `%Array.prototype.toString%`. `crates/kahvi-builtins/src/table.rs:195-198` already installs that intrinsic under the `\"toString\"` key. The stub in `prototype_to_string.rs` is declared in `typed_array/mod.rs` but never referenced, so its `not_implemented` body is unreachable. Giving it a separate body would create a second function object, which the spec does not allow. Wiring the stub in or removing it would mean editing files outside this ticket's scope.\n\n`./t262 built-ins/TypedArray/prototype/toString/`: 6 of 6 pass.\n\nBLOCKED: none. The dead stub in `typed_array/prototype_to_string.rs` could be removed by whoever owns `typed_array/mod.rs`, but that is cleanup, not a missing feature.",
